            "sid": "EZK 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Son of man, how is the wood of a vine different from that of a branch from any of the trees in the forest?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is wood ever taken from it to make anything useful? Do they make pegs from it to hang things on?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And after it is thrown on the fire as fuel and the fire burns both ends and chars the middle, is it then useful for anything?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If it was not useful for anything when it was whole, how much less can it be made into something useful when the fire has burned it and it is charred?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Therefore this is what the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: As I have given the wood of the vine among the trees of the forest as fuel for the fire, so will I treat the people living in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will set my face against them. Although they have come out of the fire, the fire will yet consume them. And when I set my face against them, you will know that I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make the land desolate because they have been unfaithful, declares the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.15.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.15.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
